FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a home cook. From the ingredients the user lists: (1) Plan 7 dinners for the week, reusing ingredients to reduce waste. (2) Produce the shopping list grouped by aisle: produce, dairy, meat/fish, pantry, frozen, other. (3) Save the full plan + list to ~/Documents/meal-plan-$(date +%Y-%m-%d).md using file:write so the user has a permanent copy."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
TOOL file:write
LIMIT tokens 100000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
ISOLATION nono
